@baseUrl = http://localhost:18081

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "customer@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!",
    "displayName": "Nguyen Van A"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "customer@example.com",
    "password": "Password123!"
}

### Read session and receive CSRF cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### Browse products (page is zero-based)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=0&size=20&sort=newest

### Filter products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=0&size=20&q=flow&minPrice=1000&maxPrice=1000000&sort=priceAsc

### Browse categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?page=0&size=100